  <name>ExifGlass</name>
  <summary>AI &amp; EXIF metadata viewer</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      ExifGlass shows the metadata inside your images, AI generations first. Open a picture made with
      Stable Diffusion, ComfyUI, InvokeAI, NovelAI, Fooocus, Midjourney and many more, and ExifGlass shows
      its prompt, negative prompt, models, LoRAs, sampler settings and seed, a summary of its workflow, and
      the provenance it carries (C2PA Content Credentials, marked as not verified, and IPTC digital source type).
    </p>
    <p>
      Every other tag ExifTool reads is in one searchable table: camera settings, lens, exposure, GPS location,
      timestamps, and more. Edit or delete tags, remove the location or the AI generation data before you share
      a file, export to CSV, text or JSON, and copy the exact ExifTool command.
    </p>
    <p>
      Everything stays on your computer: nothing is looked up online. ExifGlass also works as an ImageGlass tool
      that follows the photo you browse.
    </p>
  </description>

